<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.22 vs   0.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.13 vs   0.69</p>
<p> Sales		   12.18 vs  19.94</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.46 vs  16.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	33.02 vs  25.35</p>
<p> Operating profit    31.47 vs  24.68</p>
<p> Sales		  196.02 vs 164.37</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Wroclaw</p>
<p>SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
